@startuml
title Week 4 Todo App - responsibilities and dependencies
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

class "main.js" as Main <<composition root>>
class TodoController {
  - todoService: TodoService
  - todoRenderer: TodoRenderer
  + start()
  + addTask(description, type): number or null
}
class TodoService {
  + tasks: Task[]
  - storage: Storage
  + addTask(description, type): number or null
  + toggleComplete(id)
  + deleteTask(id)
  + getWorkloadSummary(): string
}
class TodoRenderer {
  - container: HTMLElement
  + render(service, justAddedId)
  + renderPendingRows(service): string
  + renderCompletedRows(service): string
}
interface Storage <<structural contract>> {
  + load(): Task[]
  + save(tasks)
}
class LocalStorageHandler {
  + load(): Task[]
  + save(tasks)
}
class Task <<plain object>> {
  id: number
  desc: string
  completed: boolean
  priority: string
  createdAt: string
}

Main ..> TodoService : creates
Main ..> TodoRenderer : creates
Main ..> LocalStorageHandler : creates and injects
Main ..> TodoController : creates; forwards Add / Enter
TodoController --> TodoService : delegates Add
TodoController --> TodoRenderer : requests render
TodoService --> Storage : constructor injection
LocalStorageHandler ..|> Storage
TodoService "1" *-- "0..*" Task : owns
TodoRenderer ..> TodoService : reads data and summary;\nforwards Done / Undo / Delete

note right of Storage
  JavaScript duck-typed contract,
  not a separate interface file.
  Test storage can replace the adapter.
end note
note bottom of TodoRenderer
  buildTaskRow is a module helper.
  The renderer does not own the task array.
end note
@enduml
